  "//react-native": "Types only. react-native-web ships no type declarations, and the bundler aliases react-native to it, so TypeScript resolves the API surface here while nothing from this package is bundled.",
  "//bundler": "Webpack, not Turbopack. Turbopack panics with a parse error somewhere in the react-native-web dependency chain; webpack's pipeline handles it. SWC still does the TypeScript and JSX transform either way, so NativeWind still needs no Babel config \u2014 only the bundler differs. Revisit when Turbopack handles react-native-web."
